# Unique Precision — Full Codebase Walkthrough

> **Manufacturing ERP** for WEDM/SEDM precision machining — job tracking, operator time logging, QC inspection, and dashboard analytics.

---

## 🏗️ High-Level Architecture

```mermaid
graph TD
    subgraph Frontend["Frontend (Vite + React 19)"]
        A[App Router] --> B[Programmer Module]
        A --> C[Operator Module]
        A --> D[QC Module]
        A --> E[Dashboard Module]
        A --> F[Admin Console]
        A --> G[User Management]
        A --> H[Billed Jobs]
        A --> I[Employee Logs]
    end

    subgraph Backend["Backend (Express 5 + TypeScript)"]
        J[API Routes] --> K[Services / Business Logic]
        K --> L[Prisma ORM]
        J --> M[Auth Middleware - JWT + RBAC]
        J --> N[Validators - Zod]
    end

    subgraph Infra["Infrastructure"]
        L --> O[(PostgreSQL - Neon)]
        P[Socket.IO] -.->|Real-time| A
        Q[Redis - Upstash] -.->|Cache| J
        R[Cloudflare R2] -.->|File Storage| J
    end

    Frontend -->|REST API| Backend
    Backend -->|WebSocket| Frontend
```

| Layer | Tech | Purpose |
|-------|------|---------|
| **Frontend** | React 19, Vite 7, React Router 7, Redux Toolkit, AG Grid, Recharts, MUI, Socket.IO Client | SPA with role-based dashboards |
| **Backend** | Express 5, TypeScript, Prisma 7, Zod 4, Socket.IO, Puppeteer | REST API + WebSocket server |
| **Database** | PostgreSQL (Neon serverless) | Primary data store |
| **Cache** | Redis (Upstash) with in-memory fallback | Dashboard metrics & master config caching |
| **Storage** | Cloudflare R2 (S3-compatible) | Job images, cut images, last images |
| **Auth** | JWT + bcrypt, role-based middleware | Login, token verification, RBAC |

