## 📊 Database Schema (13 Models)

```mermaid
erDiagram
    User ||--o{ Job : "creates"
    User ||--o{ Job : "assigned"
    User ||--o{ EmployeeLog : "logs"
    Job ||--o{ JobOperatorCapture : "captures"
    Job ||--o{ JobQuantityQaState : "qaStates"
    Job ||--o{ EmployeeLog : "logs"
    MasterConfig ||--o{ MasterConfigCustomer : "customers"
    MasterConfig ||--o{ MasterConfigMaterial : "materials"
    MasterConfig ||--o{ MasterConfigPassOption : "passOptions"
    MasterConfig ||--o{ MasterConfigSedmElectrodeOption : "electrodes"
    MasterConfig ||--o{ MasterConfigMachineOption : "machines"
    MasterConfig ||--o{ MasterConfigSedmThOption : "thOptions"

    User {
        uuid id PK
        string email UK
        string role
        string empId UK
    }

    Job {
        uuid id PK
        bigint groupId
        string customer
        decimal rate
        decimal cut
        decimal thickness
        int qty
        string sedm
        decimal totalHrs
        decimal totalAmount
        string qcDecision
        string refNumber
    }

    EmployeeLog {
        uuid id PK
        string role
        string activityType
        string status
        datetime startedAt
        datetime endedAt
        int durationSeconds
        json metadata
    }

    JobOperatorCapture {
        uuid id PK
        uuid jobId FK
        string captureMode
        int fromQty
        int toQty
    }

    JobQuantityQaState {
        uuid jobId FK
        int quantityNumber
        string status
    }
```

### Key Models

| Model | Purpose |
|-------|---------|
| **User** | All employees — roles: `ADMIN`, `PROGRAMMER`, `OPERATOR`, `QC`, `ACCOUNTANT` |
| **Job** | Central entity — each row = one "setting/cut" of a machining job, grouped by `groupId` |
| **JobOperatorCapture** | Operator's per-quantity time/machine data snapshots |
| **JobQuantityQaState** | Per-quantity QC status (PENDING/APPROVED/REJECTED) |
| **EmployeeLog** | Time-tracking entries for all roles (start/complete/reject) |
| **MasterConfig** (+children) | System-wide configuration — customers, rates, materials, SEDM settings |
| **IdleTimeConfig** | Configurable idle time reasons & durations |
| **Counter** | Auto-incrementing reference number generator |
| **SystemErrorLog** | Server-side error tracking |

