### Middleware Stack
- **Authentication**: JWT verification → `req.user` injection
- **RBAC**: Role-based access (`adminMiddleware`, [canViewOperatorScreen](file:///c:/Users/N%20KUNAL/Desktop/UNIQUE%20PRECISION/code/backend/server/src/routes/operator-routes.ts#27-29), etc.)
- **Rate Limiting**: Auth endpoints (stricter) + general API
- **Error Handling**: Centralized error middleware + JSON parse error handler
- **Security**: Helmet, CORS, compression
- **Logging**: Morgan (dev mode)

