### Module Breakdown

#### 📐 Programmer Module (83 files)
The largest module by file count. Handles job creation with complex WEDM/SEDM calculations.

- **Pages**: `ProgrammerDashboardPage` (13.7KB), `ProgrammerJobForm` (6.5KB)
- **Components** (38): Cut section, child cuts table, SEDM modal, customer/material/pass autocompletes, image upload, job details modal, filters
- **Hooks** (13): `useJobHandlers`, `useProgrammerPageController`, `useProgrammerState`, `useProgrammerLogs`, `useProgrammerGrid`, form state/validation
- **Utils** (13): SEDM calculations, thickness rates, priority sorting, CSV export, group sorting, validation
- **Styles**: 12 partitioned CSS files (~77KB total)

#### ⚙️ Operator Module (106 files)
The **most complex** module. Production floor time-tracking, machine hours, idle time, task timer, and QA pipeline.

- **Pages**: `OperatorJobListPage` (12.6KB), `OperatorJobDetailPage` (19.3KB)
- **Components** (38): Task timer, quantity cards, input sections, pause reason, idle history, send-to-QA modal, bulk assignment, multi-select operators, filters
- **Hooks** (21): `useOperatorActions`, `useOperatorRunActions`, `useOperatorPersistenceActions`, `useOperatorViewData` (16.9KB!), `useOperatorInputs`, assignment sync, logs, filters
- **Utils** (24): Machine hours calc, pause state, validation, capture payloads, QA progress, table columns/helpers, CSV export
- **Styles**: 15 partitioned CSS files (~120KB total)

#### ✅ QC Module (15 files)
Quality control — inspecting quantities, approve/reject decisions, inspection report generation.

- **Pages**: `QualityControlPage` (13.8KB), `InspectionReportPage` (15.3KB)
- **Components** (6): QC-specific UI elements
- **Utils**: QC columns, QC utils, inspection report utils

#### 📊 Dashboard Module (26 files)
Role-adaptive analytics dashboard.

- **Views**: Admin, Programmer, Operator, QC dashboards — each with role-specific metrics
- **Components** (9): MetricsCard, RevenueChart, ActivityFeed, JobTimeline, DashboardFilters, RoleViewSwitcher, PerformanceCard, TopPerformers
- **Hooks** (5): `useDashboardData` + per-role metric hooks
- **Data Source**: Redis-cached aggregations from the backend

#### 🛠️ Admin Console (5 files)
Master configuration management — customers with per-customer SEDM rates, materials, pass options, machine options, SEDM electrode/thickness options, global calculation parameters.

#### 👥 User Management (14 files)
User CRUD with role assignment, employee ID management, phone normalization.

